      { type: "p", text: "BestAIAgent.in participates in vendor affiliate programmes. This page discloses that fact, explains how affiliate relationships are walled off from editorial decisions, and tells you where to find the disclosure on each affected page." },
      { type: "h2", text: "What is an affiliate link" },
