    blocks: [
      { type: "p", text: "Every claim on BestAIAgent.in has a freshness window. When a window closes, the affected page enters a \`refresh_required\` state until the claim is re-verified. This page documents the windows we use and the page lifecycle that results." },
      { type: "h2", text: "Default windows by claim type" },
      { type: "table", rows: [["Claim type", "Window", "Rationale"], ["Vendor pricing", "90 days", "Vendor prices change without notice"], ["Model version / capability list", "60 days", "Vendors release model updates frequently"], ["Regulatory status", "180 days", "Rule changes are infrequent but consequential"], ["Protocol revision", "365 days", "Specifications change slowly"], ["Compliance certification", "180 days", "Certifications expire or are renewed annually"], ["Methodology (this page and siblings)", "180 days", "Policy is reviewed semi-annually"]] },
      { type: "h2", text: "Lifecycle states affected by freshness" },
      { type: "p", text: "The content lifecycle is defined in \`src/content/registry/content-registry.ts\`:" },
      { type: "ul", items: ["\`published\` — current and indexable.", "\`monitored\` — current but flagged for the next scheduled refresh.", "\`refresh_required\` — a receipt has aged past \`expiresAt\`; the page is removed from fresh sitemaps and \`llms.txt\` until re-verification completes.", "\`rejected\` — the page can no longer be supported and is removed from indexable surfaces."] },
      { type: "p", text: "A page in \`refresh_required\` may still be served to users (with a \"This page is being re-verified\" notice) but it does not appear in the discovery surfaces of this site until the page is back in \`published\`." },
      { type: "h2", text: "How freshness is enforced" },
      { type: "ul", items: ["Every claim in \`src/content/registry/evidence-ledger.ts\` carries an optional \`expiresAt\` date.", "A scheduled job queries the ledger for expired claims and moves the owning pages to \`monitored\` 30 days before expiry, then to \`refresh_required\` on the expiry date.", "Re-verification requires a fresh \`retrievedAt\` date and a fresh passage quotation from the cited source.", "Re-verified claims enter the ledger with the same id but updated \`verifiedAt\`, \`retrievedAt\`, and (optionally) \`expiresAt\`."] },
